                // that often fails for fresh launches.
                // V5.0.7089 §THE 1e9 SUPPLY CONSTANT WAS APPLIED TO TOKENS THAT
                // ARE NOT PUMP.FUN TOKENS, AND THAT IS WHERE THE FAKE ENTRY
